  "notes": "> **⚠️ Important notice for users on 0.14.0-alpha.9 – 0.14.0**: these versions have a bug that prevents automatic updates from completing. Please open `https://uniclipboard.app/download` in your browser, download the latest installer, and reinstall manually.\n\n## 0.16.0-alpha.7 - 2026-06-22\n\n### Features\n\n- Add cross-device active clipboard syncing, including a Sync on restore setting that can make restored history entries active on your other devices (#1117)\n- Add a Congestion controller selector in Network settings so users can choose the network flow-control mode that best fits their connection (#1121)\n\n### Fixes\n\n- Improve local-network transfer speed by making the faster local-network mode the default (#1121)\n\n<!-- zh -->\n\n> **⚠️ 重要公告（0.14.0-alpha.9 ~ 0.14.0 用户）**：这些版本存在自动更新缺陷，点击安装后无法完成更新。请在浏览器中打开 `https://uniclipboard.app/download`，手动下载最新安装包覆盖安装。\n\n## 0.16.0-alpha.7 - 2026-06-22\n\n### Features\n\n- 新增跨设备当前剪贴板同步，并加入「恢复时同步」设置，可将从历史记录恢复的内容同步为其他设备上的当前剪贴板 (#1117)\n- 在网络设置中新增「拥塞控制算法」选择器，用户可按自己的网络连接选择更合适的流量控制模式 (#1121)\n\n### Fixes\n\n- 将更适合局域网的模式设为默认值，提升本地网络传输速度 (#1121)",
